{
 "budget": "<section class=\"cyh-tool\" id=\"budget\">\n  <span class=\"cyh-num\">Calculator 01</span>\n  <h2>Budget Builder</h2>\n  <p class=\"cyh-sub\">Add every income source and every monthly expense. Your breathing room updates as you type. If the number is negative, that is information, not failure.</p>\n\n  <div class=\"cyh-grid\">\n    <div class=\"cyh-col\">\n      <h3>Monthly Income</h3>\n      <div id=\"cyh-inc\"></div>\n      <button class=\"cyh-add\" onclick=\"cyhAdd('cyh-inc','Income source')\">+ Add income source</button>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"cyh-col\">\n      <h3>Monthly Expenses</h3>\n      <div id=\"cyh-exp\"></div>\n      <button class=\"cyh-add\" onclick=\"cyhAdd('cyh-exp','Expense')\">+ Add expense</button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"cyh-out\">\n    <div class=\"cyh-stat pos\"><b id=\"cyh-ti\">$0</b><span>Total Income</span></div>\n    <div class=\"cyh-stat neg\"><b id=\"cyh-te\">$0</b><span>Total Expenses</span></div>\n    <div class=\"cyh-stat\"><b id=\"cyh-br\">$0</b><span>Breathing Room</span></div>\n    <div class=\"cyh-stat gold\"><b id=\"cyh-sr\">0%</b><span>Savings Rate</span></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"cyh-msg\" id=\"cyh-budmsg\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"cyh-link\">\n    <span>Learn it</span>\n    <a href=\"stage-1-survive.html#tools\">Stage 1: Survive &mdash; Zero-Based Budgeting</a>\n    <a href=\"stage-2-stabilize.html\">Stage 2: Stabilize</a>\n  </div>\n</section>",
 "paycheck": "<section class=\"cyh-tool\" id=\"paycheck\">\n  <span class=\"cyh-num\">Calculator 02</span>\n  <h2>Paycheck Split</h2>\n  <p class=\"cyh-sub\">Where should each dollar go? Pick the profile that matches your actual situation &mdash; the standard 50/30/20 assumes a comfort level a lot of people do not have yet.</p>\n\n  <div class=\"cyh-grid\">\n    <div class=\"cyh-col\">\n      <div class=\"cyh-field\">\n        <label for=\"cyh-pcAmt\">Monthly take-home pay</label>\n        <input type=\"number\" id=\"cyh-pcAmt\" placeholder=\"3200\" oninput=\"cyhPaycheck()\" value=\"3200\">\n        <p class=\"cyh-hint\">Net pay &mdash; what actually lands in your account, not gross salary.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"cyh-col\">\n      <div class=\"cyh-field\">\n        <label for=\"cyh-pcMode\">Your situation</label>\n        <select id=\"cyh-pcMode\" onchange=\"cyhPaycheck()\">\n          <option value=\"50,30,20\">Comfortable &mdash; income covers everything (50/30/20)</option>\n          <option value=\"67,13,20\">Tight &mdash; barely covering essentials (67/13/20)</option>\n          <option value=\"80,5,15\">Crisis &mdash; income below expenses (80/5/15)</option>\n          <option value=\"52,23,25\">Variable / gig income (52/23/25, includes tax set-aside)</option>\n        </select>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"cyh-out\">\n    <div class=\"cyh-stat\"><b id=\"cyh-pcN\">$0</b><span>Needs</span></div>\n    <div class=\"cyh-stat\"><b id=\"cyh-pcW\">$0</b><span>Wants</span></div>\n    <div class=\"cyh-stat pos\"><b id=\"cyh-pcS\">$0</b><span>Savings + Debt</span></div>\n    <div class=\"cyh-stat gold\"><b id=\"cyh-pcY\">$0</b><span>Per Year Saved</span></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"cyh-msg\" id=\"cyh-pcMsg\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"cyh-link\">\n    <span>Learn it</span>\n    <a href=\"stage-1-survive.html\">Stage 1 &mdash; Budgeting on Irregular Income</a>\n  </div>\n</section>",
 "emergency": "<section class=\"cyh-tool\" id=\"emergency\">\n  <span class=\"cyh-num\">Calculator 03</span>\n  <h2>Emergency Fund</h2>\n  <p class=\"cyh-sub\">How long until you have a real cushion. Start at $1,000 &mdash; that single buffer is what means you never need a payday loan again.</p>\n\n  <div class=\"cyh-grid\">\n    <div class=\"cyh-col\">\n      <div class=\"cyh-field\">\n        <label for=\"cyh-efNow\">Saved right now</label>\n        <input type=\"number\" id=\"cyh-efNow\" placeholder=\"0\" oninput=\"cyhEF()\" value=\"0\">\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"cyh-field\">\n        <label for=\"cyh-efMo\">Can save per month</label>\n        <input type=\"number\" id=\"cyh-efMo\" placeholder=\"100\" oninput=\"cyhEF()\" value=\"100\">\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"cyh-col\">\n      <div class=\"cyh-field\">\n        <label for=\"cyh-efExp\">Monthly essential expenses</label>\n        <input type=\"number\" id=\"cyh-efExp\" placeholder=\"2000\" oninput=\"cyhEF()\" value=\"2000\">\n        <p class=\"cyh-hint\">Housing, food, transport, utilities, minimum debt payments. Used for the 3&ndash;6 month targets.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"cyh-out\">\n    <div class=\"cyh-stat\"><b id=\"cyh-ef500\">&ndash;</b><span>To $500 buffer</span></div>\n    <div class=\"cyh-stat gold\"><b id=\"cyh-ef1k\">&ndash;</b><span>To $1,000 goal</span></div>\n    <div class=\"cyh-stat\"><b id=\"cyh-ef3\">&ndash;</b><span>To 3-month fund</span></div>\n    <div class=\"cyh-stat\"><b id=\"cyh-ef6\">&ndash;</b><span>To 6-month fund</span></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"cyh-msg\" id=\"cyh-efMsg\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"cyh-link\">\n    <span>Learn it</span>\n    <a href=\"stage-1-survive.html\">Stage 1 &mdash; Three-Tier Safety Net</a>\n    <a href=\"stage-2-stabilize.html\">Stage 2 &mdash; Your First $1,000</a>\n  </div>\n</section>",
 "sinking": "<section class=\"cyh-tool\" id=\"sinking\">\n  <span class=\"cyh-num\">Calculator 05</span>\n  <h2>The Life Just Happened Fund</h2>\n  <p class=\"cyh-sub\">List the annual expenses you already know are coming. Divide by twelve. Car registration stops being a crisis and becomes a non-event.</p>\n\n  <div id=\"cyh-sf\"></div>\n  <button class=\"cyh-add\" onclick=\"cyhAddSF()\">+ Add an annual expense</button>\n\n  <div class=\"cyh-out\">\n    <div class=\"cyh-stat gold\"><b id=\"cyh-sfMo\">$0</b><span>Save Per Month</span></div>\n    <div class=\"cyh-stat\"><b id=\"cyh-sfYr\">$0</b><span>Total Per Year</span></div>\n    <div class=\"cyh-stat\"><b id=\"cyh-sfN\">0</b><span>Expenses Tracked</span></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"cyh-msg\">\n    <b>Keep this separate.</b> Not in checking, not mixed with your emergency fund. Label the account\n    &ldquo;Planned Expenses&rdquo; and automate the transfer on payday. The whole point is that the money is\n    already there when the bill arrives.\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"cyh-link\">\n    <span>Learn it</span>\n    <a href=\"stage-1-survive.html\">Stage 1 &mdash; The Life Just Happened Fund</a>\n  </div>\n</section>",
 "debtlist": "<section class=\"cyh-tool\" id=\"debtlist\">\n  <span class=\"cyh-num\">Calculator 05</span>\n  <h2>Debt Overview</h2>\n  <p class=\"cyh-sub\">Every debt in one place. Seeing the whole picture is uncomfortable and it is also the first thing that actually changes anything.</p>\n\n  <div id=\"cyh-debt\"></div>\n  <button class=\"cyh-add\" onclick=\"cyhAddDebt()\">+ Add a debt</button>\n\n  <div class=\"cyh-out\">\n    <div class=\"cyh-stat neg\"><b id=\"cyh-dTot\">$0</b><span>Total Debt</span></div>\n    <div class=\"cyh-stat\"><b id=\"cyh-dMin\">$0</b><span>Monthly Minimums</span></div>\n    <div class=\"cyh-stat gold\"><b id=\"cyh-dHi\">&ndash;</b><span>Attack This First</span></div>\n    <div class=\"cyh-stat\"><b id=\"cyh-dInt\">$0</b><span>Interest / Year</span></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"cyh-msg\" id=\"cyh-dMsg\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"cyh-link\">\n    <span>Learn it</span>\n    <a href=\"stage-2-stabilize.html\">Stage 2 &mdash; The Debt Avalanche</a>\n    <a href=\"blog/debt-avalanche-vs-snowball.html\">Avalanche vs. Snowball &mdash; the real math</a>\n  </div>\n</section>",
 "payoff": "<section class=\"cyh-tool\" id=\"payoff\">\n  <span class=\"cyh-num\">Calculator 06</span>\n  <h2>Debt Payoff Timeline</h2>\n  <p class=\"cyh-sub\">One debt, two questions: how long, and what does the interest actually cost you. Then see what one extra payment per month does to both.</p>\n\n  <div class=\"cyh-grid\">\n    <div class=\"cyh-col\">\n      <div class=\"cyh-field\">\n        <label for=\"cyh-poBal\">Balance</label>\n        <input type=\"number\" id=\"cyh-poBal\" placeholder=\"5000\" oninput=\"cyhPayoff()\" value=\"5000\">\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"cyh-field\">\n        <label for=\"cyh-poApr\">Interest rate (APR %)</label>\n        <input type=\"number\" id=\"cyh-poApr\" placeholder=\"22.9\" step=\"0.1\" oninput=\"cyhPayoff()\" value=\"22.9\">\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"cyh-col\">\n      <div class=\"cyh-field\">\n        <label for=\"cyh-poPay\">Monthly payment</label>\n        <input type=\"number\" id=\"cyh-poPay\" placeholder=\"150\" oninput=\"cyhPayoff()\" value=\"150\">\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"cyh-field\">\n        <label for=\"cyh-poEx\">Extra per month (optional)</label>\n        <input type=\"number\" id=\"cyh-poEx\" placeholder=\"50\" oninput=\"cyhPayoff()\" value=\"25\">\n        <p class=\"cyh-hint\">Try $25. The difference is usually larger than people expect.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"cyh-out\">\n    <div class=\"cyh-stat\"><b id=\"cyh-poTime\">&ndash;</b><span>Time to Payoff</span></div>\n    <div class=\"cyh-stat neg\"><b id=\"cyh-poInt\">$0</b><span>Interest Paid</span></div>\n    <div class=\"cyh-stat pos\"><b id=\"cyh-poSaveT\">&ndash;</b><span>Time Saved</span></div>\n    <div class=\"cyh-stat pos\"><b id=\"cyh-poSave\">$0</b><span>Interest Saved</span></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"cyh-msg\" id=\"cyh-poMsg\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"cyh-link\">\n    <span>Learn it</span>\n    <a href=\"stage-2-stabilize.html\">Stage 2 &mdash; Debt Avalanche &amp; Collector Rights</a>\n  </div>\n</section>",
 "util": "<section class=\"cyh-tool\" id=\"util\">\n  <span class=\"cyh-num\">Calculator 07</span>\n  <h2>Credit Utilization</h2>\n  <p class=\"cyh-sub\">Roughly 30% of a FICO score, and the only major factor that resets every single month. This is the fastest-moving number you control.</p>\n\n  <div class=\"cyh-grid\">\n    <div class=\"cyh-col\">\n      <div class=\"cyh-field\">\n        <label for=\"cyh-utBal\">Total balances across all cards</label>\n        <input type=\"number\" id=\"cyh-utBal\" placeholder=\"1800\" oninput=\"cyhUtil()\" value=\"1800\">\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"cyh-col\">\n      <div class=\"cyh-field\">\n        <label for=\"cyh-utLim\">Total credit limits</label>\n        <input type=\"number\" id=\"cyh-utLim\" placeholder=\"6000\" oninput=\"cyhUtil()\" value=\"6000\">\n        <p class=\"cyh-hint\">Add up the limit on every card, including ones you never use.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"cyh-out\">\n    <div class=\"cyh-stat\"><b id=\"cyh-utPct\">&ndash;</b><span>Utilization</span></div>\n    <div class=\"cyh-stat\"><b id=\"cyh-ut30\">&ndash;</b><span>Pay Down to Hit 30%</span></div>\n    <div class=\"cyh-stat gold\"><b id=\"cyh-ut10\">&ndash;</b><span>Pay Down to Hit 10%</span></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"cyh-msg\" id=\"cyh-utMsg\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"cyh-link\">\n    <span>Learn it</span>\n    <a href=\"stage-1-survive.html\">Stage 1 &mdash; How Your Credit Score Works</a>\n    <a href=\"stage-3-rebuild.html\">Stage 3 &mdash; Credit Repair</a>\n    <a href=\"blog/chexsystems-explained.html\">ChexSystems Explained</a>\n  </div>\n</section>",
 "compound": "<section class=\"cyh-tool\" id=\"compound\">\n  <span class=\"cyh-num\">Calculator 08</span>\n  <h2>Compound Interest</h2>\n  <p class=\"cyh-sub\">The whole argument for starting now instead of later, in one number. Watch what happens when you change the years and nothing else.</p>\n\n  <div class=\"cyh-grid\">\n    <div class=\"cyh-col\">\n      <div class=\"cyh-field\">\n        <label for=\"cyh-ciStart\">Starting amount</label>\n        <input type=\"number\" id=\"cyh-ciStart\" placeholder=\"500\" oninput=\"cyhCompound()\" value=\"500\">\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"cyh-field\">\n        <label for=\"cyh-ciMo\">Added per month</label>\n        <input type=\"number\" id=\"cyh-ciMo\" placeholder=\"100\" oninput=\"cyhCompound()\" value=\"100\">\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"cyh-col\">\n      <div class=\"cyh-field\">\n        <label for=\"cyh-ciYrs\">Years invested</label>\n        <input type=\"number\" id=\"cyh-ciYrs\" placeholder=\"30\" oninput=\"cyhCompound()\" value=\"30\">\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"cyh-field\">\n        <label for=\"cyh-ciRate\">Annual return (%)</label>\n        <input type=\"number\" id=\"cyh-ciRate\" placeholder=\"7\" step=\"0.1\" oninput=\"cyhCompound()\" value=\"7\">\n        <p class=\"cyh-hint\">7% is a common long-run assumption for a broad stock index after inflation. It is an assumption, not a promise.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"cyh-out\">\n    <div class=\"cyh-stat gold\"><b id=\"cyh-ciEnd\">$0</b><span>Ending Balance</span></div>\n    <div class=\"cyh-stat\"><b id=\"cyh-ciIn\">$0</b><span>You Contributed</span></div>\n    <div class=\"cyh-stat pos\"><b id=\"cyh-ciGain\">$0</b><span>Growth</span></div>\n    <div class=\"cyh-stat\"><b id=\"cyh-ciMult\">&ndash;</b><span>Multiple of Input</span></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"cyh-msg\" id=\"cyh-ciMsg\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"cyh-link\">\n    <span>Learn it</span>\n    <a href=\"stage-3-rebuild.html\">Stage 3 &mdash; Compound Interest in Action</a>\n    <a href=\"stage-4-invest.html\">Stage 4 &mdash; Index Funds</a>\n  </div>\n</section>",
 "invest": "<section class=\"cyh-tool\" id=\"invest\">\n  <span class=\"cyh-num\">Calculator 09</span>\n  <h2>Investment Growth Projector</h2>\n  <p class=\"cyh-sub\">The same math as above, run against three market outcomes at once. Real markets do not deliver an average every year &mdash; this shows the spread you should plan around.</p>\n\n  <div class=\"cyh-grid\">\n    <div class=\"cyh-col\">\n      <div class=\"cyh-field\">\n        <label for=\"cyh-igStart\">Starting balance</label>\n        <input type=\"number\" id=\"cyh-igStart\" placeholder=\"1000\" oninput=\"cyhInvest()\" value=\"1000\">\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"cyh-field\">\n        <label for=\"cyh-igMo\">Monthly contribution</label>\n        <input type=\"number\" id=\"cyh-igMo\" placeholder=\"250\" oninput=\"cyhInvest()\" value=\"250\">\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"cyh-col\">\n      <div class=\"cyh-field\">\n        <label for=\"cyh-igYrs\">Years</label>\n        <input type=\"number\" id=\"cyh-igYrs\" placeholder=\"25\" oninput=\"cyhInvest()\" value=\"25\">\n        <p class=\"cyh-hint\">Time horizon does more work here than contribution size. Change this field and watch.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <table class=\"cyh-tbl\">\n    <thead><tr><th>Scenario</th><th>Annual Return</th><th>Ending Balance</th><th>Growth</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody id=\"cyh-igBody\">\n      <tr><td colspan=\"4\" style=\"color:var(--mut)\">Enter your numbers above.</td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n  <div class=\"cyh-msg\">\n    <b>Why three numbers instead of one.</b> A projection that shows a single figure implies a\n    certainty that does not exist. Markets deliver their long-run average almost never in any\n    individual year &mdash; they overshoot, undershoot, and occasionally fall hard. Plan against the\n    conservative row and treat the optimistic one as upside.\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"cyh-link\">\n    <span>Learn it</span>\n    <a href=\"stage-4-invest.html\">Stage 4 &mdash; Dollar-Cost Averaging &amp; Risk</a>\n    <a href=\"markets.html\">Live Markets</a>\n    <a class=\"cyh-paid\" href=\"technical-analysis.html\">Technical Analysis Course</a>\n  </div>\n</section>",
 "networth": "<section class=\"cyh-tool\" id=\"networth\">\n  <span class=\"cyh-num\">Calculator 10</span>\n  <h2>Net Worth Tracker</h2>\n  <p class=\"cyh-sub\">Everything you own minus everything you owe. It is allowed to be negative &mdash; most people's is, early on. What matters is the direction it moves.</p>\n\n  <div class=\"cyh-grid\">\n    <div class=\"cyh-col\">\n      <h3>Assets &mdash; What You Own</h3>\n      <div id=\"cyh-asset\"></div>\n      <button class=\"cyh-add\" onclick=\"cyhAdd('cyh-asset','Asset')\">+ Add asset</button>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"cyh-col\">\n      <h3>Liabilities &mdash; What You Owe</h3>\n      <div id=\"cyh-liab\"></div>\n      <button class=\"cyh-add\" onclick=\"cyhAdd('cyh-liab','Liability')\">+ Add liability</button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"cyh-out\">\n    <div class=\"cyh-stat pos\"><b id=\"cyh-nwA\">$0</b><span>Total Assets</span></div>\n    <div class=\"cyh-stat neg\"><b id=\"cyh-nwL\">$0</b><span>Total Liabilities</span></div>\n    <div class=\"cyh-stat gold\"><b id=\"cyh-nwT\">$0</b><span>Net Worth</span></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"cyh-msg\" id=\"cyh-nwMsg\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"cyh-link\">\n    <span>Learn it</span>\n    <a href=\"stage-5-wealth.html\">Stage 5 &mdash; Build Wealth</a>\n    <a href=\"disability-wealth-guide.html\">Disability Wealth Guide</a>\n  </div>\n</section>",
 "freedom": "<section class=\"cyh-tool\" id=\"freedom\">\n  <span class=\"cyh-num\">Calculator 11</span>\n  <h2>Your Financial Freedom Number</h2>\n  <p class=\"cyh-sub\">The amount of invested money that could cover your life indefinitely. It is driven by what you spend, not what you earn &mdash; which is why cutting expenses moves it from both directions at once.</p>\n\n  <div class=\"cyh-grid\">\n    <div class=\"cyh-col\">\n      <div class=\"cyh-field\">\n        <label for=\"cyh-ffSpend\">Monthly spending</label>\n        <input type=\"number\" id=\"cyh-ffSpend\" placeholder=\"3000\" oninput=\"cyhFreedom()\" value=\"3000\">\n        <p class=\"cyh-hint\">What your life actually costs each month, all in.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"cyh-field\">\n        <label for=\"cyh-ffHave\">Invested already</label>\n        <input type=\"number\" id=\"cyh-ffHave\" placeholder=\"10000\" oninput=\"cyhFreedom()\" value=\"10000\">\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"cyh-col\">\n      <div class=\"cyh-field\">\n        <label for=\"cyh-ffSave\">Investing per month</label>\n        <input type=\"number\" id=\"cyh-ffSave\" placeholder=\"500\" oninput=\"cyhFreedom()\" value=\"500\">\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"cyh-field\">\n        <label for=\"cyh-ffRate\">Assumed annual return (%)</label>\n        <input type=\"number\" id=\"cyh-ffRate\" placeholder=\"7\" step=\"0.1\" oninput=\"cyhFreedom()\" value=\"7\">\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"cyh-out\">\n    <div class=\"cyh-stat gold\"><b id=\"cyh-ffNum\">$0</b><span>Freedom Number</span></div>\n    <div class=\"cyh-stat\"><b id=\"cyh-ffYrs\">&ndash;</b><span>Years to Get There</span></div>\n    <div class=\"cyh-stat pos\"><b id=\"cyh-ffPct\">0%</b><span>Of the Way There</span></div>\n    <div class=\"cyh-stat\"><b id=\"cyh-ffMo\">$0</b><span>It Would Pay You / Mo</span></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"cyh-msg\" id=\"cyh-ffMsg\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"cyh-link\">\n    <span>Learn it</span>\n    <a href=\"stage-5-wealth.html\">Stage 5 &mdash; Compound Growth &amp; Tax Strategy</a>\n    <a class=\"cyh-paid\" href=\"fundamental-analysis.html\">Fundamental Analysis Course</a>\n  </div>\n</section>"
}
